---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About HK Pet Portal" lang="en">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 md:py-12">
    <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-near-black mb-4">🐾 About HK Pet Portal</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-sm text-gray-600 space-y-4">
      <p>HK Pet Portal is an information platform built by Hong Kong pet owners, aimed at helping everyone find dog-friendly restaurants, pet health information, and local HK pet news more easily.</p>
      <p>Restaurant data is sourced from the public FEHD (Food and Environmental Hygiene Department) list. Health articles are adapted from professional course notes with original content rewritten in.</p>
      <p>The platform is still under active development — upcoming features include restaurant ratings, pet-friendly mall guides, and parking information.</p>
      <p>Have questions or suggestions? Feel free to reach out.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>